Origin stories
  The plain-language "Origin" text on each kanji page is generated by Anthropic's
  Claude (Haiku) from the component and meaning data above. It is a convenience
  summary, not scholarship, and is stored with a review flag
  (origin_story_reviewed) so unverified text can be identified.
